<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;color:#172033;">Reset your password</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;">Use this code to reset your Qampus password.</p>
<div class="qampus-code" style="margin:0 0 20px;font-family:'Cascadia Mono','SFMono-Regular',Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:44px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:0.14em;font-weight:700;color:#002A7A;"><%= code %></div>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">This code expires in <%= ttlMinutes %> minutes, at <%= expiresLabel %>.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#5B6472;">If you did not request a password reset, contact the office.</p>
